<title>UK: Bear Stearns sets 1.0 billion FRF six-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets 1.0 billion FRF six-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager joint lead managers Bear Stearns, BNP and SocGen.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BEAR STEARNS COS INC</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.25 PCT  MATURITY    22.MAY.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.49    PAY DATE    22.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    98.965    SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A2	  DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
